uage. NLP encompasses many techniques and tasks such as sentiment analysis,=
 named entity recognition, and machine translation.</li> <li><strong>LLMs (=
Large Language Models)</strong> are a powerful subset of NLP models charact=
erized by their massive size, extensive training data, and ability to perfo=
rm a wide range of language tasks with minimal task-specific training. Mode=
ls like the Llama, GPT, or Claude series are examples of LLMs that have rev=
olutionized what=E2=80=99s possible in NLP.</li></ul> <p data-svelte-h=3D"s=
